WEBVTT

37:33.084 --> 37:35.125
Some other guy was trying to stab you.

37:35.542 --> 37:36.792
I intervened to stop him.

37:36.875 --> 37:38.375
Do I look like a fool to you?

37:39.250 --> 37:40.542
Am I looking like a fricking fool?

37:40.750 --> 37:42.792
-I really don't know, sir.
-Okay, no problem.
